      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-4 pt-4">
        <a href="#shop" class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-headline-md text-[18px] clinical-shadow hover:brightness-110 transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
          Shop Now
